orthant 1 language

- # `↯/s.27.2` — Binary literal contains non-binary character
+ # `↯/s.27.2` — Un littéral binaire contient un caractère non binaire

- Raised at compile time by Hypotenuse's `bin"…"` literal macro when
- the body contains a character that is not `0` or `1`.
+ Levée à la compilation par la macro du littéral `bin"…"` d'Hypotenuse lorsque
+ le corps contient un caractère autre que `0` ou `1`.

- ## Cause
+ ## Cause

- Binary literals must be exclusively `0` and `1`.
+ Les littéraux binaires ne doivent contenir que des `0` et des `1`.

- ## Example message
+ ## Exemple de message

=
- ```
+ ```

- [↯/s.27.2] a binary value can only contain characters '0' or '1'
+ [↯/s.27.2] a binary value can only contain characters '0' or '1'

= [↯/s.27.2] a binary value can only contain characters '0' or '1'
- ```
+ ```

- ## Resolution
+ ## Résolution

- Remove or correct the offending character.
+ Supprimez ou corrigez le caractère fautif.

